GIVEN `the action is for advancement of expenses or for indemnification brought under this section or under a bylaw, agreement, vote of stockholders or disinterested directors, or otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 145(k) the Court of Chancery has exclusive jurisdiction over the action` `the action is for advancement of expenses or for indemnification brought under this section or under a bylaw, agreement, vote of stockholders or disinterested directors, or otherwise` MEANS
    IF   `the action is for advancement of expenses or for indemnification brought under this section or under a bylaw, agreement, vote of stockholders or disinterested directors, or otherwise`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING

